{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"b2c0000000000001","type":"group","x":-1000,"y":-520,"width":740,"height":800,"color":"2","label":"二、单纯同调 (Simplicial Homology)"},
		{"id":"b3c0000000000001","type":"group","x":-900,"y":500,"width":740,"height":780,"color":"3","label":"三、奇异同调 (Singular Homology)"},
		{"id":"b1c0000000000001","type":"group","x":600,"y":-300,"width":710,"height":580,"color":"1","label":"一、Δ-复形 (Δ-Complexes)"},
		{"id":"c3d0000000000001","type":"text","text":"## 奇异同调\n\n放弃单纯形的刚性要求\n允许任意连续映射\n所得同调天然是拓扑不变量","x":-870,"y":550,"width":280,"height":120,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"d3e0000000000001","type":"text","text":"**奇异 n-单纯形**\n\n任意连续映射 $\\sigma: \\Delta^n \\to X$\n\"奇异\"：不必是嵌入\n可以有皱缩、折叠","x":-490,"y":540,"width":260,"height":100},
		{"id":"d3e0000000000002","type":"text","text":"**链群** $C_n(X)$\n\n以全体奇异 n-单纯形为基\n的自由 Abel 羨\n通常不可数基 → 巨大","x":-490,"y":660,"width":260,"height":100},
		{"id":"d3e0000000000003","type":"text","text":"**边界 & 同调**\n\n$\\partial_n$ 公式与单纯情形相同\n$\\partial^2=0$ 同样成立\n$H_n(X) = \\ker\\partial_n / \\mathrm{Im}\\partial_{n+1}$","x":-490,"y":780,"width":260,"height":100},
		{"id":"d3e0000000000004","type":"text","text":"**奇异复形** $S(X)$\n\n每个奇异单纯形 $\\sigma$ 对应\n一个单纯形 $\\Delta^n_\\sigma$\n$H_n^\\Delta(S(X)) = H_n(X)$\n奇异同调 = 特殊的单纯同调","x":-490,"y":900,"width":260,"height":100},
		{"id":"d3e0000000000005","type":"text","text":"**基本性质**\n\nProp 2.6: $H_n(X) \\cong \\bigoplus H_n(X_\\alpha)$\nProp 2.7: 路连通时 $H_0 \\cong \\mathbb{Z}$\nProp 2.8: 单点空间 $H_n=0$ ($n>0$)","x":-490,"y":1020,"width":260,"height":80},
		{"id":"d3e0000000000006","type":"text","text":"**约化同调** $\\widetilde{H}_n(X)$\n\n增广链复形末尾加 $\\varepsilon: C_0 \\to \\mathbb{Z}$\n$\\widetilde{H}_0(X) = H_0(X) \\ominus \\mathbb{Z}$\n$\\widetilde{H}_n = H_n$ ($n>0$)\n单点空间所有约化同调 = 0","x":-490,"y":1120,"width":260,"height":80},
		{"id":"a0b1c2d3e4f5a6b7","type":"text","text":"# §2.1 单纯同调与奇异同调\n\nHatcher *Algebraic Topology* Ch.2\n\n[[00.Inbox/Hatcher - Section 2.1 Simplicial and Singular Homology]]","x":-20,"y":250,"width":400,"height":160,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"d2e0000000000001","type":"text","text":"**链群** $\\Delta_n(X)$\n\n以开 n-单纯形 $e^n_\\alpha$ 为基\n的自由 Abel 群\n元素 = 形式整系数线性组合","x":-590,"y":-460,"width":260,"height":100},
		{"id":"d2e0000000000002","type":"text","text":"**边界同态** $\\partial_n$\n\n$\\partial_n(\\sigma_\\alpha) = \\sum_i (-1)^i \\sigma_\\alpha|_{[v_0,\\cdots,\\hat{v}_i,\\cdots,v_n]}$\n交替符号保证面朝向一致","x":-590,"y":-340,"width":260,"height":100},
		{"id":"c2d0000000000001","type":"text","text":"## 单纯同调\n\n从 Δ-复形的单纯形\n出发构造链群与边界\n再取闭链/边链之商","x":-970,"y":-270,"width":280,"height":120,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"d2e0000000000003","type":"text","text":"**Lemma 2.1** $\\partial^2=0$\n\n两次取边界 = 零\n两次删顶点 $v_i,v_j$ 的项\n交换 $i,j$ 后正负抵消","x":-590,"y":-220,"width":260,"height":100},
		{"id":"d2e0000000000004","type":"text","text":"**链复形**\n\n$\\cdots \\to C_{n+1} \\xrightarrow{\\partial_{n+1}} C_n \\xrightarrow{\\partial_n} C_{n-1} \\to \\cdots$\n满足 $\\partial_n \\partial_{n+1}=0$","x":-590,"y":-100,"width":260,"height":100},
		{"id":"d2e0000000000005","type":"text","text":"**同调群** $H_n^\\Delta(X)$\n\n$H_n = \\ker\\partial_n / \\mathrm{Im}\\partial_{n+1}$\n闭链 mod 边链\n同调类 = 闭链的等价类","x":-590,"y":20,"width":260,"height":100},
		{"id":"d2e0000000000006","type":"text","text":"**计算例子**\n\n$S^1$: $H_0\\cong H_1\\cong\\mathbb{Z}$\n$T$: $H_1\\cong\\mathbb{Z}\\oplus\\mathbb{Z}$\n$\\mathbb{R}P^2$: $H_1\\cong\\mathbb{Z}_2$\n$S^n$: $H_n\\cong\\mathbb{Z}$","x":-620,"y":150,"width":260,"height":100},
		{"id":"d1e0000000000002","type":"text","text":"**标准 n-单纯形** $\\Delta^n$\n\n$\\sum t_i=1, t_i\\geq0$ \n坐标轴单位向量作顶点","x":980,"y":-140,"width":260,"height":90},
		{"id":"d1e0000000000003","type":"text","text":"**面 & 边界**\n\n删去 $v_i$ → $(n-1)$-面\n$\\partial\\Delta^n$ = 所有面之并\n$\\mathring{\\Delta}^n$ = 内部","x":980,"y":-40,"width":260,"height":80},
		{"id":"d1e0000000000004","type":"text","text":"**Δ-复形结构三条件**\n\n① 开单纯形 injective 且无重叠\n② 靿限制 = 已有的低维映射\n③ 商拓扑 = 弱拓扑","x":980,"y":60,"width":260,"height":80},
		{"id":"d1e0000000000005","type":"text","text":"**重心坐标**\n\n$(t_0,\\cdots,t_n) \\mapsto \\sum t_i v_i$\n$t_i$ 为点在单纯形中的坐标","x":980,"y":160,"width":260,"height":80},
		{"id":"c1d0000000000001","type":"text","text":"## Δ-复形\n\n用三角形（单纯形）\n逐维粘贴构造空间\n的推广框架","x":600,"y":-50,"width":280,"height":120,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"d1e0000000000001","type":"text","text":"**n-单纯形** $[v_0,\\cdots,v_n]$\n\n$\\mathbb{R}^m$ 中 $n+1$ 个\n不共超平面的点之凸包","x":980,"y":-240,"width":260,"height":80}
	],
